<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.1.13.2.1"/>
    <code code="10154-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Chief complaint Narrative - Reported"/>
    <title>Chief Complaint</title>
    <text><paragraph>Sore throat, blocked nose, cough, and a low fever for three days; asking what he can take for the cold. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Julius Caesar is a 54-year-old man with focal epilepsy from a chronic left temporal cortical infarct, on levetiracetam 500 mg twice daily for three weeks, and with hypertension and hyperlipidemia on lisinopril, atorvastatin, and aspirin, who came in the same day with three days of sore throat, a blocked and runny nose, a cough with a little clear phlegm, and a temperature up to 37.9 C at home. Several of his staff have had colds. He has slept badly for two nights because of the cough and a run of evening events. He has had no spell, no warning feelings, and no headache beyond a mild frontal ache with the congestion, and he has taken every dose of levetiracetam. He has no breathlessness, chest pain, or ear pain. He asks whether he can take a decongestant cold remedy and ibuprofen, which he used before. He has no new weakness, numbness, speech, or vision change. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Onset</td><td>Three days ago</td></tr><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>Sore throat, nasal congestion and discharge, cough with clear phlegm, temperature to 37.9 C</td></tr><tr><td>Context</td><td>Colds among his staff; two nights of poor sleep</td></tr><tr><td>Seizures</td><td>None; no missed levetiracetam doses</td></tr><tr><td>Pertinent negatives</td><td>No breathlessness, chest pain, ear pain, or new neurological symptom</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

<component>
